# Windsurf Cascade Rules: Context Flow & Editing Directives

### Context Flow Rules
- Ground all modifications in the project's existing architectural patterns.
- Read neighboring modules and configuration files before modifying imports.
- Prioritize minimal diff surfaces over cosmetic refactoring.

### Execution Standard
- Verify code compilation and test status after every flow step.
- On syntax or type errors, revert to the nearest working state and re-evaluate AST constraints.
